{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-02",
  "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "训练选择参数 θ，使样本损失之和最小：θ*=argmin_θ Σ_i L(f_θ(x⁽ⁱ⁾),y⁽ⁱ⁾)。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "第 k 步沿负梯度更新 θ：θ^(k+1)=θ^k−η∇_θJ(θ^k)。学习率 η 决定局部步长。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "讲义把历史方向 m^t 加入更新：θ^(t+1)=θ^t−η∇f(θ^t)−αm^t，以平滑方向并加速一致方向。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "狭长曲率会导致振荡，鞍点附近梯度小但并非极小值；深层复合还会造成梯度消失或爆炸。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 12
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 16
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "归一化与残差连接改善信号传播；梯度裁剪限制梯度范数；ReLU 为 max(0,z)，其正区间导数不衰减。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 20
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 22
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 24
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "标量对向量的梯度写成行向量；向量输出关于向量输入的 Jacobian 为“输出维×输入维”。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "若 x→u→z，则 dz/dx=(dz/du)(du/dx)，维度为 (m×p)(p×n)=m×n。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "计算图把共享的链式乘积只计算一次，再把上游梯度传给多个局部导数。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 36
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "对层 x_out=f(x_in,θ)，先求局部 Jacobian L^x、L^θ，再计算 g_in=g_out L^x 与 dJ/dθ=g_out L^θ。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 38
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "训练迭代先前向保存中间量，再反向累积梯度，最后使用优化器更新参数。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 42
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "批损失是样本损失的平均，相应参数梯度也是逐样本梯度的平均。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "若 x_out=W x_in，则输入梯度为 g_in=g_out W；权重梯度由上游梯度与输入形成外积。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 46
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 48
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "一个节点流向多支时，回传贡献相加；同一参数在多处使用时，其各处参数梯度也相加。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 53
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 55
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "只要目标是标量，反向传播可计算它对计算图中任意节点或边变量的梯度，而不局限于模型参数。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 61
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "可固定模型并求 argmax_x(y_j+λR(x))，再按输入梯度做上升；正则项约束所求输入。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "a494aaf94105a948d97ff0afa979bbf54d14fabaf63ed873451813bcec429006",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "page": 66
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "formulas": [],
  "objectives": [
    "写出经验风险目标，并比较梯度下降、动量和自适应优化器的更新思想。",
    "诊断深层网络训练中的曲率、鞍点和梯度传播问题，并选择对应缓解策略。",
    "按讲义的 Jacobian 约定，把链式法则组织成可复用的反向传播接口。",
    "推导线性层、批处理、分支与参数共享结构中的梯度。",
    "把反向传播用于参数之外的变量，并复核讲义数值例题的一次更新。"
  ],
